              "help": {
                "markdown": "Protect the specific browser rendering context\n\n- Remediate established vulnerabilities and poor practice. For Review items, resolve the named evidence before deciding whether or how behavior needs to change.\n- Use escaped template output for HTML text and quoted non-active attributes; use textContent for plain DOM text.\n- For intentional rich HTML, apply a verified maintained sanitizer before every sink; inspect its configuration and version.\n- Treat script, URL, event-handler and unquoted-attribute contexts separately. HTML entity encoding alone does not protect them.\n- Preserve source, storage and output links when fixing reflected or stored flows; test the protected counterpart.\n",
                "text": "Protect the specific browser rendering context. Remediate established vulnerabilities and poor practice. For Review items, resolve the named evidence before deciding whether or how behavior needs to change. Use escaped template output for HTML text and quoted non-active attributes; use textContent for plain DOM text. For intentional rich HTML, apply a verified maintained sanitizer before every sink; inspect its configuration and version. Treat script, URL, event-handler and unquoted-attribute contexts separately. HTML entity encoding alone does not protect them. Preserve source, storage and output links when fixing reflected or stored flows; test the protected counterpart."
